        "slc_c0c442e1a64953028d7483809c3f92457f7607267e06ad7844b4f265cce7ed3c"
      ],
      "text": "The podiomd daemon embeds the web SPA and uses pure-Go SQLite, so it needs no external web assets or cgo at runtime."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4fdf498203856b650c8e8c6c71458f9585a556b079b559c5b904387b1cf8196c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "78025f74007775e4e161ab5632ee6a19f616fbc1",
          "git_sha": "84cb3dc6019aee0f91d74e444aada34afe3eed71",
          "line_end": 210,
          "line_start": 204,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "podiom/podiom",
          "url": "https://github.com/Podiom/Podiom/blob/78025f74007775e4e161ab5632ee6a19f616fbc1/README.md#L204-L210"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b7d9b8fcd8a65316d4674ea10d894981d7f59f84cad3ba8dec6d7e23fc1d74e0"
      ],
      "text": "The layout includes a thin CLI client (cmd/podiom), a daemon combining web server, scheduler, and core (cmd/podiomd), internal packages, and a Svelte/Vite/TypeScript/Tailwind web UI built into podiomd."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fb975e63c4deff15c7cbd8230e1d99226cd9ed3b8423ea3a2c574c84df73bd52",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "78025f74007775e4e161ab5632ee6a19f616fbc1",
          "git_sha": "84cb3dc6019aee0f91d74e444aada34afe3eed71",
          "line_end": 43,
          "line_start": 41,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "podiom/podiom",
          "url": "https://github.com/Podiom/Podiom/blob/78025f74007775e4e161ab5632ee6a19f616fbc1/README.md#L41-L43"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0ac8d543388608f1dab67e7129f5e183c9406ad2475d949d67781fedd4b3eae0"
      ],
      "text": "Podiom does not replace the provider runtime; it shells out to the native claude and codex CLIs and reuses their models, MCP servers, tools, skills, and authentication."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fbd6e12dc15f991c4eadb946711ba4e393557d97a47701d38f23e4d0c5d1eeb8",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
