      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_eb78586603c308a7157586d3f879852db5ee6d689355ea125330c9bc4d15ffe6"
      ],
      "text": "Native iOS and Android mobile apps can connect to standalone daemons or an opt-in, API-only Home Assistant LAN endpoint, and the same core can run as a Home Assistant add-on or in a container."
    },
